 ## How the kanji combine
 
-[展](../kanji/展.md) concerns displaying or unfolding, 覧 concerns viewing, and [会](../kanji/会.md) marks a gathering or event. Their on-readings are てん + らん + かい. The final 会 identifies an exhibition event, not the individual object on display.
